**What does this PR do?** 
Improve PBToast to match web and allow custom PBUser padding.

PBToast changes to match web:
- Info color not "status gray" anymore but "text color light";
- Shadow opacity and rgb slighlty tweaked;
- Created a .tip variant for toast so we can use the new gradient background color without disrupting what is already working;
- Allow the dev to pass an "animated icon" to PBToast, so we don't have fixed animations set and keep it dynamic.


